# Line endings.
#
# The "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings come from Git's autocrlf
# setting converting on checkout. Normalizing here makes the behaviour
# explicit and identical for everyone: text is stored as LF in the
# repository, and Windows checkouts get CRLF where it matters.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-native files keep CRLF in the working tree.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary files must never be converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.ldb binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
